## Workflow {#workflow}

### Draft {#workflow-draft}

Authors work in text-first source, then preview through web, TUI, or export
surfaces.

### Validate {#workflow-validate}

Validation checks profiles, IDs, references, TOC scope, tables, images, and
safe URL/resource policy.

### Publish {#workflow-publish}

Publishing can target HTML, package bundles, NCP, or preview export formats.

